---
---
<section id="installation" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="tag">Installation</span>
      <h2>Get started in <span class="gradient-text">two minutes</span></h2>
      <p>Download the ZIP and load it in Chrome developer mode.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="install-grid">
      <div class="card install-card">
        <div class="install-head">
          <div class="install-num">1</div>
          <h3>Download the ZIP</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Grab the ZIP of the latest release from GitHub.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/ScathachGrip/shiftypad-extension/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"/><line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"/></svg>
          Download latest release
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="card install-card">
        <div class="install-head">
          <div class="install-num">2</div>
          <h3>Extract the archive</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Unzip to a permanent folder on your machine.</p>
        <div class="note">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"/></svg>
          Keep the folder in a place where it will not be moved or deleted.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card install-card">
        <div class="install-head">
          <div class="install-num">3</div>
          <h3>Load in Chrome</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Open <code>chrome://extensions</code>, enable <strong>Developer mode</strong>, click <strong>Load unpacked</strong>, and select the folder.</p>
        <div class="note">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
          Version <strong>0.0.17</strong> should appear in the extension card.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card install-card">
        <div class="install-head">
          <div class="install-num">4</div>
          <h3>Contribute</h3>
        </div>
        <p>This project is open source — @sinkaroid are not the best developer, so there are sure some problematic coding decision, every slight of changes will helps. I'm always happy to receive Pull requests to improve things.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/ScathachGrip/shiftypad-extension" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline" style="width:100%;justify-content:center;">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"/></svg>
          View on GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .install-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .install-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .install-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .install-num {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary), var(--color-primary-dim));
    color: #fff;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .install-card h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .install-card p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .install-card p code {
    background: var(--primary-dim);
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .note {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    background: var(--primary-dim);
    border: 1px solid rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.1);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .note svg {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .install-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .install-card {
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .code-block {
      padding: 10px;
    }
  }
</style>
